{% # theme-check-disable LiquidComplexity %}
{%- comment -%}
  gift-options.liquid is added to product pages via a Custom Liquid block
  (rendered at runtime), so theme-check can't see the reference and flags it as
  an orphaned snippet. This guarded render is never executed (if false) but makes
  the reference visible to static analysis, clearing the OrphanedSnippet warning.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign gift_ref = false -%}
{%- if gift_ref -%}{% render 'gift-options' %}{%- endif -%}
{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  Dynamic Customizer — AirPods Pro 3 engraving experience
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  HOW TO INSTALL (Shopify):
  1. In your theme code editor (Online Store > Themes > ... > Edit code),
     under "Sections", click "Add a new section", name it
     "dynamic-customizer", and REPLACE its contents with this whole file.
  2. Upload the 10 image files to "Assets" (Add a new asset):
     logo.svg, airpods-pro-3.png, gal-1.png, gal-2.png, gal-3.png, gal-4.png, gal-5.png, ic-test.png, ic-aid.png, ic-protect.png
  3. Add the section to any template/page:
     - Theme editor: Add section > "Dynamic Customizer", OR
     - In a template .json: add a block referencing "dynamic-customizer".
  Libraries (Fabric.js, GSAP) load from CDN. No app or backend required.
  When placed on a PRODUCT template, "Add to Bag" adds the real product to the
  cart with the engraving saved as a line-item property (shows on the order).
  On non-product pages it runs in demo mode and logs the payload to the console.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} The five customization fonts (typing bar + design popup) are
   Google Fonts — loaded here so previews, the live product overlay and the
   canvas proof all render them. {%- endcomment -%}
{% # theme-check-disable RemoteAsset %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Caveat:wght@500;600&family=Dancing+Script&family=Great+Vibes&family=Montserrat:wght@500;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600&display=swap">
{% # theme-check-enable RemoteAsset %}

{%- comment -%}
  On a product page, ALWAYS use that page's own product so one "Default product"
  template works for every product. The manual picker is only a fallback for when
  this section is placed on a non-product page (home page, custom page, etc.).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} Feature blocks (each limited to one). Their settings feed the config below;
   the presence of a block is what turns its feature on. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign blk_bulk = blank -%}
{%- assign blk_reviews = blank -%}
{%- assign blk_gift = blank -%}
{%- assign blk_print = blank -%}
{%- assign blk_source = blank -%}
{%- assign cust_method = blank -%}
{%- assign blk_m = blank -%}
{%- for block in section.blocks -%}
  {%- case block.type -%}
    {%- when 'bulk_link' -%}{%- assign blk_bulk = block -%}
    {%- when 'reviews' -%}{%- assign blk_reviews = block -%}
    {%- when 'gift' -%}{%- assign blk_gift = block -%}
    {%- when 'print_area' -%}{%- assign blk_print = block -%}
    {%- comment -%} One "Print method" block; the method comes from its dropdown. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'method_dtf' -%}
      {%- if cust_method == blank -%}
        {%- assign blk_m = block -%}
        {%- assign cust_method = block.settings.method_label | default: 'DTF' | downcase -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- when 'product_source' -%}{%- assign blk_source = block -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- comment -%} No Print method block = plain product: no Customize popup, the
   customer just adds it to the cart. The block IS the customization switch. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign customize_on = true -%}
{%- if cust_method == blank -%}{%- assign customize_on = false -%}{%- assign cust_method = 'uv' -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- assign dyn_product = product -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign dyn_product = blk_source.settings.product_ref -%}
{%- endif -%}
<script type="application/json" id="dyn-config">
{
